                                "sense_id": "659154a6-bc7a-34ea-9411-0cebae05fbfe",
                                "text": "The agency was given to some deserving politician who, as he knew nothing at all about Indians and spoke no language except traces of back-street American, would not be prejudiced in Indian affairs and interfere with the highly informed traders."
                            },
